 "note": "LEADER's second face: the same body to the number, with LEADER OF EARTH (espeak en-earth) band-limited below the consonant band as the ELEMENT and Jaimla an octave above entirely IN ECHO at OVERLORD's 1.00:0.62 ratio. What differs is what is behind the voice, never who is speaking. The operator keeps this face on `anchor: true` by choice."
